iya","isRemote":false,"text":"撤出當前區域！優先保護傷患和醫療幹員！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"狙擊小隊......！瞄準整合運動符號，射擊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"破壞它的結構！解體整棟大樓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸引起的霧氣更濃了——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"趁現在！動作快！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"全員撤出廣場區域！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"逃掉了——嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"你看了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"幾分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"這些戰士值得稱讚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"你的身體狀況不理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"——用不著你來提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar"